[{'group': 'BarSeriesManager.getTransactionCostModel - basic behavior', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'transactionCostModel', 'value': 'new ZeroCostModel()'}], 'expected': 'returns the same ZeroCostModel instance passed to the constructor', 'description': 'Verify that when the manager is created with a ZeroCostModel, the getter returns that exact instance.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'transactionCostModel', 'value': 'mock(CostModel.class)'}], 'expected': 'returns the same mock CostModel instance passed to the constructor', 'description': 'Ensure that a custom CostModel (e.g., a Mockito mock) is returned unchanged by the getter.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'transactionCostModel', 'value': 'null'}], 'expected': 'returns null', 'description': "Check the getter's behavior when the manager is constructed with a null transactionCostModel (if the constructor permits null)."}]}]
```

